

>> Cat := Objek baru.

Cat saat: ['baru'] lakukan: {
	milik sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat saat: ['nieuw'] lakukan: {
	milik sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat saat: ['makeSound'] lakukan: { <- milik sound.
}.

Cat saat: ['greet'] lakukan: { <- diri makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat baru.
Keluaran tulis: cat greet.
